    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30033" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγώνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γωνία</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forming an angle</i>, esp. <i>right angle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθοι ἐντομῇ ἐγγώνιοι</span>
			cut <i>square</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.93
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					7.8.3
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.115
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
